OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones says US move
OL,4,Ahumbled her before big break with
OL,5,ASteven Spielberg
OL,6,
OL,7,FCatherine Zeta-Jones has said she had
OL,8,Fan ego check after moving to America in
OL,9,Fthe 1990s.
OL,11,FThe Swansea-born star had become a
OL,12,Fhousehold name in the UK, but Hollywood
OL,13,Fquickly provided a reality check for
OL,14,Fthe rising star and she was even asked
OL,15,Fby casting agents if she had any acting
OL,16,Fexperience.
OL,18,FIt was during her stint on CBS
OL,19,Fmini-series Titanic that she was seen
OL,20,Fby Steven Spielberg who suggested she
OL,21,Fgo for a role in The Mask of Zorro,
OL,22,Fwhich he was producing.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
