OL,3,ACatherine Zeta-Jones says US move
OL,4,Ahumbled her before big break with
OL,5,ASteven Spielberg
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Five days later I got the job, and
OL,8,Fthree days after that, I was down there
OL,9,Fstarting my sword-fighting lessons,"
OL,10,Fshe said.
